(7569554, 1214935, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Very well done! The bruises are very realistic looking. Congrats on the ribbon. You have a very understanding partner to let you disappear for a month:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Some of the bruises are real... and the eyes bags as well (just a very delicate burning, otherwise it was too much - they are called Petrini''s signature). As for being away, it''s my job. There will be a moment in the future when I relax on the sofa watching romantic movies - ok, get rid the rid of the last part of the sentence)</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Very well done! The bruises are very realistic looking. Congrats on the ribbon. You have a very understanding partner to let you disappear for a month:)   Some of the bruises are real... and the eyes bags as well (just a very delicate burning, otherwise it was too much - they are called Petrini''s signature). As for being away, it''s my job. There will be a moment in the future when I relax on the sofa watching romantic movies - ok, get rid the rid of the last part of the sentence)', '2018-05-30 06:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
