(7569589, 1214924, 114969, '<td valign="top">I love ghosts and castles! <br/>I''m sure this had the potential for a much better result, but I would have adjusted something about the depth of field. I find it a bit strange: the flowers next to the ghost lady are quite blurry, while she is perfectly sharp. It''s hard for the mind to understand how far from the camera she actually is standing.<br/>Also, the foreground big flowers, are, well, big, and draw attention from the ghost. This is probably intentional, but maybe it could also work with the emphasis on the character.<br/>Just some thoughts :) Congrats on the nice finish!</td>', 'I love ghosts and castles! I''m sure this had the potential for a much better result, but I would have adjusted something about the depth of field. I find it a bit strange: the flowers next to the ghost lady are quite blurry, while she is perfectly sharp. It''s hard for the mind to understand how far from the camera she actually is standing.Also, the foreground big flowers, are, well, big, and draw attention from the ghost. This is probably intentional, but maybe it could also work with the emphasis on the character.Just some thoughts :) Congrats on the nice finish!', '2018-05-30 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
